# Commands and flags the skill mentions that are not in commandCatalog().
# Same idea as basecamp-cli's .surface-skill-drift: an acknowledged list, so
# a real regression still fails the build.
#
# Format: one entry per line, "suppyhq <path>" or "--flag".

# The skill names these to tell the agent they DON'T exist:
#   "There's no `suppyhq draft` followed by `suppyhq promote`."
suppyhq draft
suppyhq promote

# Dispatched in main.go but deliberately not advertised in the catalog.
suppyhq help
